  "status": "PASS",
  "residual": "Original coupling-infimum/KR-test supremum identification for arbitrary probability laws with finite first moments on a separable Borel pseudometric space; in particular the usual first-moment Polish metric profile. Quantizers, bounded finite extensions, normalized restricted-cell product lifts, exact marginals and cost integrability are constructed. General optimal-coupling attainment and actual first-moment-space completeness are separate from this infimum-identification theorem."
